# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Never commit real URLs with secrets
# (this file itself holds no secrets and is safe to commit).
#
# Local dev: leave EMPTY (same-origin /api via the Vite dev proxy).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
#
# Production on Vercel:
# - Recommended same-origin /api proxy: leave EMPTY and rewrite /api/* to the
#   Render service; the session cookie stays first-party.
# - Same-site custom domains: use the API subdomain with NO trailing slash and
#   NO /api suffix, then REDEPLOY (Vite embeds it at build time).
# Shape only — use your real hostname:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# Do NOT point *.vercel.app directly at *.onrender.com: the SameSite=Lax
# session cookie is cross-site and will not be sent.
